flowchart LR
  Admin[Administrador] --> Login[Admin login]
  Login --> Gate{Cookie válido?}
  Gate -- não --> Login
  Gate -- sim --> Dashboard[AdminShell / dashboard]
  Dashboard --> Review[Fila de quotes]
  Dashboard --> Commercial[Clientes, empresas, catálogo]
  Dashboard --> Financial[Orders, invoices, Asaas]
  Dashboard --> AI[Mind, knowledge, conversations]
  Dashboard --> Webhooks[Eventos e reprocessamento]

  Financial --> Mutations[Ações server-side]
  Webhooks --> Mutations
  Mutations --> Backend[devbutter_backend]
  Backend --> External[Relay / Asaas / Mind]

  Public[Usuário público] --> Maintenance[Manutenção]
  Public --> Waitlist[POST waitlist]
  Waitlist --> Hook[Webhook configurado]
